0829, "text": "And Isaac breathed his last, and died, and was gathered to his people, being old and full of days: and his sons Esau and Jacob buried him.", "words": [[0, 211428], [4, 211554], [10, 211874], [19, 212494], [23, 212614], [29, 213534], [33, 213594], [39, 214314], [43, 214494], [47, 214654], [56, 214974], [59, 215214], [63, 215354], [71, 216014], [77, 216234], [81, 216634], [85, 216814], [90, 217054], [93, 217174], [99, 218139], [103, 218419], [107, 218539], [112, 218839], [117, 219479], [121, 219719], [127, 220039], [134, 220439]]}]}